    <string name="mixed_pack_title">Animated and still stickers together</string>
    <string name="mixed_pack_body">This pack has %1$d animated and %2$d still stickers. WhatsApp only accepts a pack that is all one or all the other.

Splitting keeps both, as two packs. Keeping them together saves the smaller group as still images, losing their animation.</string>
